      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm coaching a high school debate team and one of my students is doing a round on Universal Basic Income (UBI). They're currently on the pro side, but I really need to help them prepare for when the opposition comes at them. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible? I want them to be ready for anything.",
